  "title": "Shopping at the Airport Duty-Free Shop",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2023-11-16",
  "synopsis": "Amy is at the airport duty-free shop. She wants to buy a gift from China for her family.\nThis lesson focuses on learning how to shop in an airport duty-free shop, including discussing prices and payment methods.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/2236/4d49a81f33cdad7320b8285206c8d89341df4fc5.mp3?1696849056",
