    "title": "Amy’s Trip to Beijing",
    "chapter": 14,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "在机场免税店买东西\n\n爱米：你好，这茶叶多少钱？\n服务员：您好，茶叶五百块。\n爱米：能便宜点儿吗？\n服务员：对不起，我们这里是免税店，已经是最便宜的了。这是我们这里最好的茶叶。\n爱米：我明白了。我要买这个茶叶。\n服务员：好的。请问您用现金还是刷卡？\n爱米：刷卡。\n服务员：能看一下您的登机牌和护照吗？\n爱米：没问题。给！\n服务员：好了！这是您的茶叶。谢谢！\n爱米：谢谢！再见！",
    "traditional": "在機場免稅店買東西\n\n愛米：你好，這茶葉多少錢？\n服務員：您好，茶葉五百塊。\n愛米：能便宜點兒嗎？\n服務員：對不起，我們這裡是免稅店，已經是最便宜的了。這是我們這裡最好的茶葉。\n愛米：我明白了。我要買這個茶葉。\n服務員：好的。請問您用現金還是刷卡？\n愛米：刷卡。\n服務員：能看一下您的登機牌和護照嗎？\n愛米：沒問題。給！\n服務員：好了！這是您的茶葉。謝謝！\n愛米：謝謝！再見！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shopping at the Airport Duty-Free Shop"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "爱米：你好，这茶叶多少钱？",
      "traditional": "愛米：你好，這茶葉多少錢？",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ nǐ hǎo zhè chá yè duō shao qián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: Hello, how much is this tea?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "服务员：您好，茶叶五百块。",
      "traditional": "服務員：您好，茶葉五百塊。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán nín hǎo chá yè wǔ bǎi kuài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Clerk: Hello, the tea is 500 yuan."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "爱米：能便宜点儿吗？",
      "traditional": "愛米：能便宜點兒嗎？",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ néng pián yi diǎn'r ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: Can you make it a little cheaper?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "服务员：对不起，我们这里是免税店，已经是最便宜的了。这是我们这里最好的茶叶。",
      "traditional": "服務員：對不起，我們這裡是免稅店，已經是最便宜的了。這是我們這裡最好的茶葉。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán duì bu qǐ wǒ men zhè lǐ shì miǎn shuì diàn yǐ jīng shì zuì pián yi de le zhè shì wǒ men zhè lǐ zuì hǎo de chá yè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Clerk: I’m sorry, this is a duty-free shop. It’s already the cheapest. This is the best tea we have here."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "爱米：我明白了。我要买这个茶叶。",
      "traditional": "愛米：我明白了。我要買這個茶葉。",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ wǒ míng bai le wǒ yào mǎi zhè ge chá yè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: I see. I want to buy this tea."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "服务员：好的。请问您用现金还是刷卡？",
      "traditional": "服務員：好的。請問您用現金還是刷卡？",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán hǎo de qǐng wèn nín yòng xiàn jīn hái shi shuā kǎ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Clerk: Sure. Will you use cash or card?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "爱米：刷卡。",
      "traditional": "愛米：刷卡。",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ shuā kǎ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: Card."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "服务员：能看一下您的登机牌和护照吗？",
      "traditional": "服務員：能看一下您的登機牌和護照嗎？",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán néng kàn yí xià nín de dēng jī pái hé hù zhào ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Clerk: Can I see your boarding pass and passport?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "爱米：没问题。给！",
      "traditional": "愛米：沒問題。給！",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ méi wèn tí gěi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Amy: No problem. Here!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "服务员：好了！这是您的茶叶。谢谢！",
      "traditional": "服務員：好了！這是您的茶葉。謝謝！",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán hǎo le zhè shì nín de chá yè xiè xie",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Clerk: Great! This is your tea. Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "爱米：谢谢！再见！",
      "traditional": "愛米：謝謝！再見！",
      "pinyin": "ài mǐ xiè xie zài jiàn",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
