      "",
      "Clerk: Sure. Will you use cash or card?",
      "",
      "Amy: Card.",
      "",
      "Clerk: Can I see your boarding pass and passport?",
      "",
      "Amy: No problem. Here!",
      "",
      "Clerk: Great! This is your tea. Thank you!",
      "",
      "Amy: Thank you! Goodbye!"
